    </Requirement>
    <Requirement id="ER-P098-02" level="1" requirementType="inspection">
      <sysml:Name>法兰连接处渗漏检查</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水系统压力试验时，应重点观察法兰连接处，确保无渗漏。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="inspection" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P098" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-CCS-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-WELD-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-WELD-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>法兰连接处渗漏未及时发现，可能导致冷却水泄漏，影响系统正常运行并造成设备损坏。</RiskIfUnmet>
        <ApplicabilityConstraint>本条需求基于CCS、IACS等船级社规则证据，适用范围限于入级该等船级社的船舶；其他船级社应按其规则确认。</ApplicabilityConstraint>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>试验期间法兰连接处无可见渗漏。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>试验压力按船级社规则或项目试验程序确认，保压时间按项目调试大纲要求。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【法兰连接处渗漏检查】，来自原始需求「重点观察法兰连接处无渗漏」。E-CCS-COOL-002、E-SUPP-WELD-002、E-SUPP-WELD-001均明确要求水压试验不得有渗漏，直接支撑法兰连接处渗漏检查要求。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
